| `make long-scripts` `[local]` | Proposes each launch key whose last run `scripts/launch.py` recorded took longer than the threshold and that `launcher.long_scripts` does not list, so a person can size it for the farm. It reads only; it is in neither `make check-all` nor `make verify`, because a fresh clone has no recorded run and judging nothing exits 13 (`ExitCode.NOTHING_JUDGED`). | `make long-scripts` | [`launcher.long_after_seconds`](settings.md#configprojectjson) | Proposes; it never edits config. A run with no duration is unjudged. | [limits-and-troubleshooting.md](../guides/limits-and-troubleshooting.md) | always |
